---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-diagram-controls</code> zooms, fits and returns a diagram canvas to its start. Put it in the canvas's
  <code>controls</code> slot, or anywhere on the page with <code>for</code> set to the canvas's id. Clicking the
  zoom level opens a menu with 50%, 100%, 200%, fit, zoom to selection and back to start. Undo and redo join the
  bar when the canvas is <code>editable</code> (unless <code>hide-history</code> is set).
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-diagram id="controls-diagram" editable style="height: 360px;">
    <wc-diagram-controls slot="controls"></wc-diagram-controls>
  </wc-diagram>

  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const diagram = document.querySelector('#controls-diagram');
      diagram.nodes = [
        { id: 'a', position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, headline: 'Draft', icon: 'edit_note' },
        { id: 'b', position: { x: 300, y: 120 }, headline: 'Published', icon: 'public', intent: 'success' },
      ];
      diagram.edges = [{ id: 'e', source: 'a', target: 'b', label: 'publish' }];
    })();
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Vertical, outside the canvas</h3>
<p>
  <code>orientation="vertical"</code> stacks the buttons, for a rail beside the canvas. The bar is a toolbar: Tab
  reaches it once and the arrow keys move between its buttons.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; width: 100%;">
    <wc-diagram-controls for="rail-diagram" orientation="vertical"></wc-diagram-controls>
    <wc-diagram id="rail-diagram" style="height: 300px; flex: 1;"></wc-diagram>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (() => {
      const diagram = document.querySelector('#rail-diagram');
      diagram.nodes = [
        { id: 'a', position: { x: 0, y: 0 }, headline: 'Start', icon: 'play_arrow' },
        { id: 'b', position: { x: 260, y: 0 }, headline: 'Finish', icon: 'flag' },
      ];
      diagram.edges = [{ id: 'e', source: 'a', target: 'b' }];
    })();
  </script>
</DemoComponentCard>
